5
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:20,320
Okay, sir, wait a moment.

6
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:21,560
Slave, go call mom now.

7
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:31,540
The girl who took the exam waited until the young master

8
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:33,380
Ping'er girl

9
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:47,260
Even if I want to kill you, be good.

10
00:00:51,730 --> 00:00:53,290
I have already communicated with my father

11
